 ruins together. Coordinate roles and push deeper as a squad to restore more of the island and uncover what brought this utopia to its knees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST ELYSIUM TO FOLLOW THE JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is waking up. Be there when it does.</p>","developers":["Artifika Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/8a06a661a82ad3af426305620db988e8abf274aa/header.jpg?t=1760684843","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2354810/676049510/5b7b2862577ca51cafc10d4ac262194e49614fd0/1754410298/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754423045","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2354810/676049510/5b7b2862577ca51cafc10d4ac262194e49614fd0/1754410298/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754423045","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2354810/676049510/5b7b2862577ca51cafc10d4ac262194e49614fd0/1754410298/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754423045","id":257178592,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178592/movie480.mp4?t=1754423045","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178592/movie_max.mp4?t=1754423045"},"name":"Elysium Gameplay Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178592/5d4fb523abad1c3b47ad53af41e71613618e3cee/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754423045","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178592/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754423045","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178592/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754423045"}}],"name":"Elysium","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><